From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] winscard: the smart card database (card types, ATRs, interfaces, providers)

The smart card database calls were stubs. Card middleware registers its
card types with SCardIntroduceCardType, and programs find the CSP, KSP or
minidriver for an inserted card with SCardListCards (by ATR) and
SCardGetCardTypeProviderName. They now keep the card types where Windows
keeps them, in HKLM\Software\Microsoft\Cryptography\Calais\SmartCards\<name>
("ATR", "ATRMask", "Primary Provider", "Supported Interfaces", "Crypto
Provider", "Smart Card Key Storage Provider", "80000001").
---
diff --git a/dlls/winscard/Makefile.in b/dlls/winscard/Makefile.in
index 3947104..55e138f 100644
--- a/dlls/winscard/Makefile.in
+++ b/dlls/winscard/Makefile.in
@@ -2,8 +2,10 @@ MODULE    = winscard.dll
 IMPORTLIB = winscard
 UNIXLIB   = winscard.so
 UNIX_LIBS = $(PCSCLITE_LIBS)
+IMPORTS   = advapi32
 
 SOURCES = \
+	carddb.c \
 	rsrc.rc \
 	unixlib.c \
 	winscard.c
diff --git a/dlls/winscard/carddb.c b/dlls/winscard/carddb.c
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..1a886b1
--- /dev/null
+++ b/dlls/winscard/carddb.c
@@ -0,0 +1,655 @@
+/*
+ * Smart card database: card types, their ATRs, interfaces and providers
+ *
